{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "將欲誦戒，故先歸命三寶，以求加被。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "迦提此云昴星，昴星直此月故，即七月十六日至八\n月十五月是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下三字上應有訖字\n二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白、黑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五、四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問，此上有種種讚戒功能，今何不錄。答，以上歸命中，及戒序中，曾已略具。\n今末法凡情，心多懈怠，樂簡厭繁，復恐延遲誦戒，故不錄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0767001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0767001", "type": "orig", "text": "（梵網経菩薩戒略疏卷八ノ附。󴦒）"}
